What that means in practice:

- **Evaluation**: You may evaluate the software free of charge for up to 31
  consecutive days (the in-app trial gives you 14 days on each machine).
- **Continued use requires a paid license** for everyone except the
  copyright holder: EUR 40 per user per year, available at
  <https://whisperdictate.vercel.app>. A purchased license covers one named
  user on any number of their own machines and includes updates published
  during the twelve-month term. Commercial license terms are set out in the
  license agreement presented at purchase (see also website/terms.html).
- **No distribution**: You may not redistribute, resell, or host the
  software or builds of it (PolyForm Free Trial grants no distribution
  rights).
- **Source**: The source code is published so you can inspect exactly what
  the software does with your data; publishing it does not grant any use
  beyond what the license below allows.

Third-party packages and model weights keep their own licenses — see
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md. Nothing in this notice restricts what those
licenses grant for the components themselves.

